NewMU [SimTalk] - DismantleStation
Sets the path of the MU, which the DismantleStation designated by <Path> creates.
Remarks
NewMU applies when the DismantleStation designated by <Path> deletes the main MU and creates a new
MU instead.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
