Sequence [SimTalk] - DismantleStation
Sets how the DismantleStation designated by <Path> distributes the MUs to the successors to which it is
connected.
Remarks
You can specify:
• "MUs to all successors":
If you select Create MUs from the drop-down list Dismantle Mode, the DismantleStation creates a new
part for each successor and moves that part there.
The DismantleStation moves the main MU to the successor, whose number you entered into the text
box Main MU to Successor with Number.
If you select Detach MUs from the drop-down list Dismantle Mode, the DismantleStation moves the
MUs to each successor in turn, except for the successor that receives the main MU.
The DismantleStation moves the main MU to the successor, whose number you entered into the text
box Main MU to Successor with Number.
If the DismantleStation has four successors for example, and if moves the main MU on to successor
number 2, it will pass the new MU on to successors number 1, 3, and 4. It moves the Main MU to the
successor with the number 2.
For these settings you have to fill out the Dismantle Table:
• "MUs exiting independent of other MUs":
Here the DismantleStation attempts to move the main MU and after that each MU on to the successor
you defined, as soon as possible.
• "Main MU after other MUs":
Here the DismantleStation first moves the mounting parts on to the successor, and then the main MU.
If you only want to unload those mounting parts from the main part which you type into the Dismantle
Table, select MUs exiting independent of other MUs or Main MU after other MUs and the Dismantle
mode > Detach MUs. Always enter a valid MU class into the column MU and a positive number into the
column Number.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Sequence:string
Sequence [SimTalk] - DismantleStation
Plant Simulation Help 11-1867
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
You can specify "MUs to all successors", "MUs exiting independent of other MUs", or
"Main MU after other MUs".
Example
MyDismantleStation.Sequence := "Main MU after other MUs"
See also
Sequence [drop-down list] - DismantleStation
