PickAndPlace Robot
PickAndPlace Robot
Use the object PickAndPlace robot for picking up a part at one station, rotating it, and placing it onto
another station.
Image
Description
The PickAndPlace robot can pick up and deliver one or more parts. To deliver several parts, type in the
Capacity. The PickAndPlace robot transports the part on to its successors within the flow of materials like
this:
• The part arrives at the exit of the predecessor. It notifies the PickAndPlace robot that it wants to be
picked up.
• The PickAndPlace robot then determines if it picks the part up or not.
◦ Without a Pull Control, the robot will be notified that a part wants to be picked up, and it accepts it.
◦ If you entered a Pull Control, the robot executes it, and when the part is selected, it will be picked up.
• The PickAndPlace robot rotates to the respective predecessor and picks the part up.
PickAndPlace Robot
